#edb/ref 17592186668658}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dfbd957b-ae33-533f-abc7-005f6521ef46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668658} :answer-field/id #uuid "158a75e3-0b5d-509f-bc84-32aaacc4133e" :answer-field/key "The function has no vertical asymptotes" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668906}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "2f92ee8b-33fa-5343-9c16-73df2f465b76" :question/math-academy-id "q-39934" :question/problem "Determine the vertical asymptotes of the function $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}+3x}{{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+8x}.$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To find the vertical asymptotes of a rational function, we factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any common factors. Then, we set the denominator equal to zero and solve for $x.$\n\nFactoring the numerator and denominator and canceling any common factors, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{{x}^{2}+3x}{{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+8x} \\\\  & =\\frac{x(x+3)}{x({x}^{2}+2x+8)} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{x}(x+3)}{\\cancel{x}({x}^{2}+2x+8)} \\\\  & =\\frac{x+3}{{x}^{2}+2x+8}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we set the denominator equal to zero:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+2x+8=0\n$$\n\nThis equation does not have any real solutions because the discriminant $D$ is negative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & ={b}^{2}-4ac \\\\  & ={2}^{2}-4(1)(8) \\\\  & =-28\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)$ has no vertical asymptotes."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329633 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115334 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "bf19e2ee-7c42-58b0-9254-5a44f315288a" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Block Diagonal and Block Triangular Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cf81b5d0-b61e-5203-bb54-801438d3461d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467500} {:answer/id #uuid "fd171565-81f8-50d3-8a91-05948557c95c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467501}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cf81b5d0-b61e-5203-bb54-801438d3461d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467500} :answer-field/id #uuid "5a853d7c-2687-518d-a446-c138652f4c7e" :answer-field/key "$A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468471} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fc4d0664-5482-5544-9e91-690f058f2d43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467502} {:answer/id #uuid "12bbe01a-fe98-5ec1-a6c8-24a6cbbe1cca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467503}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fc4d0664-5482-5544-9e91-690f058f2d43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467502} :answer-field/id #uuid "34b3dc6c-709b-5dee-acff-ac14c1ddc707" :answer-field/key "$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468472} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "825129c8-74ee-54bf-8b70-10f615c4071d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467504} {:answer/id #uuid "35dfa222-4364-5bbd-af7c-c6cfea240e47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467505}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "825129c8-74ee-54bf-8b70-10f615c4071d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467504} :answer-field/id #uuid "5535032e-f5c6-5f9b-b4e5-bbd70b524e51" :answer-field/key "$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468473} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2391fa3e-1443-5b46-884d-207e7175c4c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668669} {:answer/id #uuid "65ee46e6-2656-5d11-953d-b61edd996c7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668670}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "65ee46e6-2656-5d11-953d-b61edd996c7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668670} :answer-field/id #uuid "e7986c7e-ad3f-5069-a12a-54cd3db19300" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668912}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b1e9c127-3ff2-5d29-89f3-9a02b595895a" :question/math-academy-id "q-42138" :question/problem "Which of the following matrices are block upper triangular?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "A block upper triangular matrix can be partitioned so that it has only square blocks on the main diagonal, and the blocks below the main diagonal contain only zeros.\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our matrices.\n\n- $A$ is *not* a block upper triangular matrix since it can't be partitioned in the way described above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix},\\,A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix},\\,A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 5 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- $B$ is *not* a block upper triangular matrix since it can't be partitioned in a way described above:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 0 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 9\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $C$ is *not* a block upper triangular matrix since it can't be partitioned in a way described above:\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186332803 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172082 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "cd82d96b-34d5-5d20-b810-7ea88b0b5797" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying an Equation That Generates a Slope Field Using Stationary Points"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1400080f-29b9-5c0b-8fff-a02b1e3db551" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467638} {:answer/id #uuid "613a05d1-be2e-50ec-a143-b9bd92523dbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467639}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1400080f-29b9-5c0b-8fff-a02b1e3db551" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467638} :answer-field/id #uuid "936bcfa4-d2d6-56bc-951a-d3fb63ec7798" :answer-field/key "${y}^{′}=\\frac{1}{y}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468540} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2a5309f7-7b7d-5141-8adf-5fd91dcf5b9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467640} {:answer/id #uuid "de6a0b4d-d5db-57b2-b79f-fc23d0c4a768" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467641}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2a5309f7-7b7d-5141-8adf-5fd91dcf5b9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467640} :answer-field/id #uuid "3a065266-b7e5-54c1-b994-892844b67807" :answer-field/key "${y}^{′}={e}^{y+1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468541} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0b3cbfb6-b114-5d0c-bde7-abe9838a454d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467642} {:answer/id #uuid "3503fafc-99d4-55a2-8b84-ae4563b1ad39" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467643}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0b3cbfb6-b114-5d0c-bde7-abe9838a454d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467642} :answer-field/id #uuid "dbaebdb6-1441-5c65-a2f2-c74e1d11eb4f" :answer-field/key "${y}^{′}=x(y+1)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468542} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e85238a1-af69-5c27-a709-b9ffb1147054" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668677} {:answer/id #uuid "eab7ceb6-127d-5739-8d2c-08d9e25e5a43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668678}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eab7ceb6-127d-5739-8d2c-08d9e25e5a43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668678} :answer-field/id #uuid "451afeed-0ebd-5ade-ba43-f2abc9913049" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668916}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "009c7b44-827f-54c3-aa43-59cb0c58cb71" :question/math-academy-id "q-50143" :question/problem "![](images/50/50472b92dc5fbcc8688bb1d5459f910fb2d3f3c0ee564ba671cb6a53ce8df721.png)\n\nWhich of the following equations could have generated the slope field shown above?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "![](images/e3/e328914d55b82fdd07147f683aa44aebbc3f3e908f180e6632332119c81ce482.png)\n\n \n\nNotice that the slopes of the slope field are horizontal along the line $y=-1,$ as shown above. Therefore, the right-hand side of the differential equation should evaluate to zero on this line. \n\nWith that in mind, let's check each equation:\n\n- Equation ${y}^{′}=\\frac{1}{y}$ does *not* give the required behavior. The right-hand side of ${y}^{′}=\\frac{1}{y}$ is never zero.\n\n- Equation ${y}^{′}={e}^{y+1}$ does *not* give the required behavior. The right-hand side of ${y}^{′}={e}^{y+1}$ is never zero.\n\n- Equation ${y}^{′}=x(y+1)$ does *not* give the required behavior. The right-hand side of ${y}^{′}=x(y+1)$ evaluates to zero at $x=0$ and $y=-1.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None of those listed.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186332837 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186175956 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "60f61c26-ff2d-5343-becd-d8f44f623cd3" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements Regarding the Convergence of a Power Series"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2f76e57a-1ca0-528a-83d8-a658b709ba2c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467686} {:answer/id #uuid "2bd70b0d-74ff-575c-9f41-331c8052230a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467687}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2f76e57a-1ca0-528a-83d8-a658b709ba2c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467686} :answer-field/id #uuid "4d9f46eb-7d8b-5c31-85be-40e5cad1c55e" :answer-field/key "The series converges at $x=-3$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468564} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5888bd7f-0417-52e2-9a92-7c880ec24bfc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467688} {:answer/id #uuid "b848d96c-e2cc-5b77-b15f-3560a9b4590d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467689}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5888bd7f-0417-52e2-9a92-7c880ec24bfc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467688} :answer-field/id #uuid "ab3783e8-f88d-556b-acd1-93c5cd956bca" :answer-field/key "The series diverges at $x=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468565} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e011cc9-db9e-52c4-9b70-2cc44c5f65c0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467690} {:answer/id #uuid "7816688d-7881-5671-bc85-e7a63dbf447a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467691}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0e011cc9-db9e-52c4-9b70-2cc44c5f65c0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467690} :answer-field/id #uuid "ccae151c-97cd-5e93-9baa-a5d477ca5334" :answer-field/key "The series converges at $x=8$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468566} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0893ace0-ae6c-5cb0-ad4b-d87606f56d59" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668679} {:answer/id #uuid "122a3c03-b162-599c-a675-c19291d8f300" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668680}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "122a3c03-b162-599c-a675-c19291d8f300" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668680} :answer-field/id #uuid "1cadf7f6-1844-5987-80cd-bf023ee2086b" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668917}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "0bcb862b-db75-545a-8402-c194bc3da35a" :question/math-academy-id "q-50877" :question/problem "The power series ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}(x-3)^{n}$ converges at  $x=-2.$ Which of the following **must** be true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "The center of the expansion is $x=3,$ and since the series is convergent for $x=-2,$ this means that the radius of convergence $R$ is *at least* $5,$ i.e., $R\\ge 5.$ So, the series is convergent for every point in the interval $[-2,8).$ However, we know nothing about the convergence of the series at any point outside the interval $[-2,8).$\n\n![](images/38/38763aa0d87065a01ccdf0d94bca2a4e1d6ef227aeab4aaacb9703246eee6abf.png)\n\n \n\nWith this in mind, let's check each of our statements.\n\n- Statement “The series converges at $x=-3$” is false. Since $-3\\notin [-2,8),$ we cannot guarantee that the series is convergent at $x=-3.$\n\n- Statement “The series diverges at $x=1$” is false. Since $1\\in [-2,8),$ the series is convergent at $x=1.$\n\n- Statement “The series converges at $x=8$” is false. Since $8\\notin [-2,8),$  we cannot guarantee that the series is convergent at $x=8.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None of the given statements must be true.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186341909 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068700 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "81247553-750f-5bf7-a1c4-698ad63b5ae4" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements Regarding Left- and Right-Continuity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3a608917-3bf1-55b6-a1bb-215006677c7e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467974} {:answer/id #uuid "92f6a6c0-fc6e-5d78-b192-ddfb75af8562" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467975}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3a608917-3bf1-55b6-a1bb-215006677c7e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467974} :answer-field/id #uuid "f3ad906d-0368-5141-9cec-66c6957d94f0" :answer-field/key "The function is left-continuous at $x=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468708} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f047c94-ee38-5779-a5bd-6407415c9b57" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467976} {:answer/id #uuid "6dc2bf8d-81a1-55ee-8642-345888a14521" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467977}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "0f047c94-ee38-5779-a5bd-6407415c9b57" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467976} :answer-field/id #uuid "a2642d2c-d195-5905-a291-9e57dab38c2e" :answer-field/key "The function is right-continuous at $x=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468709} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a336d758-98c3-50be-a431-456bb56457cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467978} {:answer/id #uuid "f1b35f2b-38c6-52f2-9de5-3cb301df5ec5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467979}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a336d758-98c3-50be-a431-456bb56457cd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186467978} :answer-field/id #uuid "76ca020b-a659-58bc-aaf5-3a674b44f507" :answer-field/key "The function is continuous at $x=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468710} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "249c54ce-7acb-5e0b-96dd-abf64106823e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668693} {:answer/id #uuid "afbe246e-0662-5de4-92b9-09d4b0a9c711" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668694}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "afbe246e-0662-5de4-92b9-09d4b0a9c711" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668694} :answer-field/id #uuid "a92d8a07-01c6-5d9a-8fa7-2accb154a286" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668924}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "1f47bb47-6168-5cb8-92db-b7a3fc493275" :question/math-academy-id "q-73106" :question/problem "![](images/89/89dca4b059ccbd1fe93d000acabcbd33b5fc10389de48ef3cbae65cb4455f29e.png)\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=f(x)$ plotted above?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's look at each statement in turn:\n\n- Statement “The function is left-continuous at $x=1$” is false. The function is not left-continuous at $x=1,$ since the left-sided limit is not equal to the function value:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to {1}^{-}}f(x)=1\\ne 3=f(1)\n$$\n\n- Statement “The function is right-continuous at $x=1$” is false. The function is not right-continuous at $x=1,$ since the right-sided limit is not equal to the function value:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to {1}^{+}}f(x)=1\\ne 3=f(1)\n$$\n\n- Statement “The function is continuous at $x=1$” is false. In order for the function to be continuous at $x=1,$ it must be both left-continuous and right-continuous. However, we have already determined that the function is neither left-continuous nor right-continuous at this point.\n\nIn conclusion, none of the statements are true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342188 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192781 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1094661c-8c7c-5f85-b731-4dadb0aec310" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Whether Sets Represented Using Set Notation Are Subspaces"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e4ee9b9a-eb51-5e15-abb2-05bb1b86b139" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468082} {:answer/id #uuid "f22d2656-8795-5d89-ac40-9e4cae3d15a5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468083}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e4ee9b9a-eb51-5e15-abb2-05bb1b86b139" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468082} :answer-field/id #uuid "36e0eb83-eda5-5211-bd02-730bf01aa552" :answer-field/key "$\\begin{gathered}A=\\left\\{\\begin{gathered}⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:\\\\{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=1\\end{gathered}\\right\\}\\end{gathered}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468762} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d206fe7-45bb-5c68-ba7e-b82cba496bc9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468084} {:answer/id #uuid "e417d014-1256-54c2-b5a6-83c0e16db7b6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468085}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1d206fe7-45bb-5c68-ba7e-b82cba496bc9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468084} :answer-field/id #uuid "8a030342-3365-5302-be22-c12324e628cc" :answer-field/key "$B={⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:xyz=0}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468763} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ef52cd4-5c7a-5343-89cd-f60bf03a78bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468086} {:answer/id #uuid "993adad2-e813-5acf-9d8c-0d5673935db2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468087}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1ef52cd4-5c7a-5343-89cd-f60bf03a78bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468086} :answer-field/id #uuid "e56f414b-9b1b-5b30-aeec-c4089b6d4315" :answer-field/key "$C={⟨x,y,z⟩\\in {R}^{3}:y=-1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468764} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7ce11628-b3f5-578a-ab84-8015541fd894" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668695} {:answer/id #uuid "8d0643a8-0d37-5ac4-a88a-e9cd0e0dbf1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668696}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8d0643a8-0d37-5ac4-a88a-e9cd0e0dbf1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668696} :answer-field/id #uuid "824306a8-7a4d-51f8-ac57-01ae94ef5558" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668925}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "5037faf6-6f8a-5ea2-800f-2c136a3bb59e" :question/math-academy-id "q-74218" :question/problem "Which of the following sets is a subspace of ${R}^{3}?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each of the subsets.\n\n- The set $A$ is not a subspace because it does not contain the zero vector. Indeed, $0=⟨0,0,0⟩$ does not satisfy the condition ${x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}=1$ since ${0}^{2}+{0}^{2}+{0}^{2}\\ne 1.$\n\n- The set $B$ is not a subspace because it is not closed under vector addition. Indeed, both $a=⟨1,0,1⟩$ and $b=⟨0,1,1⟩$ belong to $B$ but \n\n$$\na+b=⟨1,0,1⟩+⟨0,1,1⟩=⟨1,1,2⟩\n$$\n\n \ndoes not satisfy the condition $xyz=0$ since $1\\cdot 1\\cdot 2\\ne 0.$\n\n- The set $C$ is not a subspace because it does not contain the zero vector. Indeed, $0=⟨0,0,0⟩$ does not satisfy the condition $y=-1$ since $0\\ne -1.$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"None.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345308 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119931 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a6a3d254-c96f-5aa0-9db6-a587eb7cb2de" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating an Expression Involving Given Determinants and Matrix Types"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65947b6c-82b4-5991-b973-67befea81244" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468208} {:answer/id #uuid "805dda68-7ce8-5f0c-839b-d424cf3215d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468209}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "65947b6c-82b4-5991-b973-67befea81244" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468208} :answer-field/id #uuid "cfc3b66d-8af1-5478-a51d-5cdeb04ff05b" :answer-field/key "$-2\\text{det}({A}^{T})-3\\text{det}(I)=7$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468825} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f5517a69-aa85-583a-ae0c-57b3675d3489" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468210} {:answer/id #uuid "668fd471-d81b-5768-83b4-27ac0bda2ba4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468211}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f5517a69-aa85-583a-ae0c-57b3675d3489" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468210} :answer-field/id #uuid "5ad968c4-d57c-568e-9e45-214524448f5a" :answer-field/key "$4\\text{det}({A}^{T})=2$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468826} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "309fbf87-4ba8-53d2-817b-acc36f8fa084" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468212} {:answer/id #uuid "8ae348c2-2cbe-582f-a32d-54ba83ae7249" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468213}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "309fbf87-4ba8-53d2-817b-acc36f8fa084" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468212} :answer-field/id #uuid "8e465ba1-1436-5630-9eb8-4db7583b91bf" :answer-field/key "$\\text{det}({A}^{T})-\\text{det}(I)=-\\frac{1}{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468827} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "052e310f-b8e2-5586-9f27-7c56bf57deb1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668709} {:answer/id #uuid "bfb92a79-150d-58c5-b1ad-2f5e7c2b61bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668710}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bfb92a79-150d-58c5-b1ad-2f5e7c2b61bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668710} :answer-field/id #uuid "c3e5cedf-afce-56e3-b3df-3539941eedab" :answer-field/key "None of the above" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668932}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "49749c9e-4840-5ef3-a87f-c1ce7810b100" :question/math-academy-id "q-77503" :question/problem "Given that $det(A)=2$, which of the following statements are true? \n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "From the properties of determinants, we know that \n\n$$\n\\text{det}({A}^{T})=\\text{det}(A)=2\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\ndet(I)=1.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement $-2\\text{det}({A}^{T})-3\\text{det}(I)=7$ is false. We have,\n\n$$\n-2\\text{det}({A}^{T})-3\\text{det}(I)=-2\\cdot 2-3\\cdot 1=-7\\ne 7.\n$$\n\n- Statement $4\\text{det}({A}^{T})=2$ is false. We have\n\n$$\n4\\text{det}({A}^{T})=4\\cdot 2=8\\ne 2.\n$$\n\n- Statement $\\text{det}({A}^{T})-\\text{det}(I)=-\\frac{1}{2}$ is false. We have\n\n$$\n\\text{det}({A}^{T})-\\text{det}(I)=2-1=1\\ne -\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is \"None.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348437 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087845 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b0b57da-f9af-5fab-a337-51ee4cb28f9e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Vertical Asymptotes With Common Factors When the Denominator Has Complex Roots"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3a23df9c-0bb4-5f06-a2ce-f50dbe498d84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439993} {:answer/id #uuid "15b3d22f-4cec-5498-90ba-670c1d780658" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439994}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3a23df9c-0bb4-5f06-a2ce-f50dbe498d84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439993} :answer-field/id #uuid "2c9ab1ab-d571-5366-9440-7a3c113c7d35" :answer-field/key "$x=-1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440354} {:answer-fie