ement.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty ,-1]\\cup [1,\\infty ),$ therefore the function doesn't have a maximum value. Hence, statements “The range of the function is $(-\\infty ,-1].$” and “$y=-1$ is the maximum value of the function” are both false.\n\n- The function's domain is all real numbers except the integer multiples of $\\pi $, such as $0,\\pm \\pi ,\\pm 2\\pi ,….$ Hence, statement “$x=15\\pi $ is in the domain” is false."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186399802 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087845 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b0b57da-f9af-5fab-a337-51ee4cb28f9e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Vertical Asymptotes With Common Factors When the Denominator Has Complex Roots"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2b695010-193a-5cbf-8437-deaea37d1e6b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439445} {:answer/id #uuid "c3eb42b0-64fa-57df-989d-34ad71b77544" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439446}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2b695010-193a-5cbf-8437-deaea37d1e6b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439445} :answer-field/id #uuid "a05fb1c2-71ab-5897-b477-b35b2b52f361" :answer-field/key "$x=-3$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440080} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "07352cca-ef41-500b-abb4-1723978e1d79" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439447} {:answer/id #uuid "b86e32e1-d38b-5979-9b96-72ba9376f584" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439448}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "073